<title>JAPAN: Takaoka Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takaoka Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 36.27		vs	   37.38</p>
<p> Operating	  292    million    vs	  758    million</p>
<p> Current	    433    million    vs	  667    million</p>
<p> Net		  190    million    vs	  270    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.80 yen	  vs	    2.55 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    106 million	  vs	 106 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Takaoka Electric Mfg Co Ltd makes power transmission and distribution equipment and is affiliated with Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc.</p>
